{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201350","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620135001:1":{"text":"アルチカさん、焦らないでください。きっと解決策は見つかりますよ！","source_cn":"教授，你别着急，我们一定能找到解决办法的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6034ADC087C2D5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620135002:1":{"text":"でも、どうして姿を見た途端に逃げちゃうんだろう……アルチカさんが怖いのでしょうか？","source_cn":"不过，小石头很害怕你吗？为什么一看见你，它就要跑走呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0F290E541885072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620135003:1":{"text":"逃げる？いいえ、ぺブルちゃんは逃げたりしてない。ちゃんとここにいるわ。ただ見えないだけで……","source_cn":"跑走？不，小石头没有走，它就在这里。只不过，我们看不见它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16EC5028782D8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620135004:1":{"text":"薬が効かなかったことが、むしろ私の推測を裏付けてる。ぺブルちゃんは逃げたのではない。<style=\"highlight\">霊体が霧散</style>して、形を成せなくなってるのよ。","source_cn":"药剂没有用，更验证了我的猜测。小石头不是逃走而消失，而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85AE01846D4FE8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620135005:1":{"text":"霊体が霧散……？","source_cn":"灵体被吹散……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x766D704C85766204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620135006:1":{"text":"簡単に言えば、ひどく摩耗している状態よ。そばにより強大な霊体が現れると形が崩れ、まるで消えてしまったように見える。","source_cn":"简单来说，它的灵体被磨损得太厉害了。就像一缕烟，当旁边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B93BFC48FC4EB75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620135007:1":{"text":"その霊体はとても弱く……もう消滅寸前のところまで来ている……","source_cn":"这也是为什么小石头只能在晚上出现，也无法和其他猫交谈的原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AF8888FC2AD959D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620135008:1":{"text":"だからこそぺブルちゃんは、人気のない夜にしか現れず、他のネコと話すこともできないの。","source_cn":"它的灵体非常微弱……已经接近无法显形的程度了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82A9E8CDB62227D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620135009:2":{"text":"ぺブルちゃん……いったい何があったの？","source_cn":"小石头……你到底经历了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3775691BC5D1401","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620135010:1":{"text":"待ってください！ぺブルちゃんの霊体が損なわれてるなら、霊体強化の魔法を使えばいいじゃないですか！？","source_cn":"等等，先别伤心！事情也不是没有解决的方法嘛，既然小石头...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58894FC66874BA76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_t